popup_text = "The cab whispers away behind you as you step through the arch and look around. The Butterfly Courtyard is wide, wrapping around a central gazebo. Boardwalk paths meander through a profusion of pots and raised beds, each overflowing with flowers. Glass sculptures of butterflies are held aloft by cunningly placed wires, seeming to float on a breeze all their own. "
